  "description": "High-level hybrid post-quantum cryptography for .NET 8 and .NET 10. Combines classical primitives (X25519, Ed25519) with NIST-standardized post-quantum algorithms (ML-KEM-768, ML-DSA-65) for hybrid key encapsulation and digital signatures. Uses native .NET 10 cryptography when available; falls back to BouncyCastle on .NET 8.",
